<div class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="pill">🎓 YOUR FREE LEARNING PARTNER</span>
      <h1>Learn Better.<br>Score <span>Higher.</span></h1>
      <p>
        कक्षा 6 से 10 तक की पढ़ाई अब आसान।
