</main>

<footer>
  <div class="brand" style="justify-content:center">
    <div class="logo">JVS</div><span>JVS Help Study</span>
  </div>
  <p>सीखो • अभ्यास करो • आगे बढ़ो</p>
  <p>Free Education Resources for Classes 6–10</p>
